  "description": "Generic database connection resolution infrastructure for TAF platform.\n\t\t\tProvides pluggable connection resolvers (Config-based and Metadata-based) with caching support.\n\t\t\tEnables any microservice to resolve database connections without tight coupling to specific services.",
  "id": "TAF.Infra.Database",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-08-04T11:53:30.937Z",
